ropertyInfo(variantType, #property_name, property_hint, hint_string), \"set_\" #property_name, \"get_\" #property_name);\r\n```","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3211670594/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3211692929","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109837#issuecomment-3211692929","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109837","id":3211692929,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6_bouB","user":{"login":"marcozee03","id":123316474,"node_id":"U_kgDOB1mo-g","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/123316474?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcozee03","html_url":"https://github.com/marcozee03","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcozee03/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcozee03/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcozee03/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcozee03/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcozee03/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcozee03/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcozee03/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcozee03/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcozee03/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-21T18:39:23Z","updated_at":"2025-08-21T18:39:23Z","body":"I see I can change that. It was a holdover since from when it was a module at first. I was using macros that I found convenient in GDExtensions. ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comm